   "detailed_description": "<h1>最新更新</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/3d4ad65712ab13dd8d22797a2a7d390c.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/3d4ad65712ab13dd8d22797a2a7d390c.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/3d4ad65712ab13dd8d22797a2a7d390c.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>最近更新</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S7「烏托邦」延續 ABI 核心的 PvP 戰術撤離體驗，同時透過全新殭屍模式進一步拓展玩法邊界：感染區（PvPvE）與殭屍無盡（PvE）。本賽季還帶來了 PvP 與主模式的大幅優化、全新武器與配件，以及更深入的局外成長系統，為每一局戰鬥帶來更多戰術選擇與配裝可能。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >殭屍模式更新</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-感染區（PvPvE）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-殭屍無盡（PvE）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-商人系統</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP 與平衡性重大更新</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-提升武器多樣性</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-模式與戰鬥平衡調整</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-強化戰後正向回饋</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩法與系統更新</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-局外成長與專精系統更新</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-全新大金（社群共創 &amp; 互動）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-物資爭奪戰 2.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-畫面表現升級</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/28f714613188bc0310d6715b738a7c02.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/28f714613188bc0310d6715b738a7c02.avif?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/c4c0ebcf022f31a20a39b4dd08e9dd61.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/c4c0ebcf022f31a20a39b4dd08e9dd61.avif?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/6a223b6316ef888690091bb0714a0d55.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/6a223b6316ef888690091bb0714a0d55.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《Arena Breakout: Infinite》中，每一次入局都是一場在榮耀與毀滅之間的博弈。從激烈的PvP交火到充滿挑戰的PvE遭遇戰，每一個決定都伴隨著風險、回報和後果。智取、力敵並成功撤離——在暗區將你完全吞噬之前。在卡莫納，真正的勝利屬於那些能夠適應環境、生存下來並帶著戰利品滿載而歸的人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/3754e30e3d49d9e137bcbb6bffe10409.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/3754e30e3d49d9e137bcbb6bffe10409.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掌握6張各具特色的地圖，涵蓋混亂的室內近戰、開闊地形以及充滿變數的野外火拼。適應逼真的動態天氣系統——包括晴天、黑夜、大霧、暴雨和極寒暴雪——在這裡，能見度的驟降可能就是撤離與死亡的分水嶺。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/dfd52b8e8417b310b8883907061d9968.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/dfd52b8e8417b310b8883907061d9968.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >體驗專為軍事愛好者打造的無與倫比的改槍系統。在75多把基礎槍械上，你可以透過20多個配件位置和900多種改裝零件，親手打造出獨一無二的戰術傑作。微調操控性、後座力和射程，為不同的對戰優化你的裝備配置，讓每一次改裝都完全契合你的手感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/19f4e004623d3a5b0beb19dd11a7be26.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/19f4e004623d3a5b0beb19dd11a7be26.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >踏入卡莫納，體驗更加順暢的入局流程。直觀的教學和豐富的易用性功能將幫助你熟悉規則並掌握基礎操作。隨著你從一名新兵成長為傳奇的專業特遣隊員，你將在三個不同的難度等級中不斷進階——普通模式、封鎖區和強化封鎖區。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/45be9458d59f50a007452a7dc96c0483.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/45be9458d59f50a007452a7dc96c0483.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Arena Breakout: Infinite》為所有特遣隊員提供了多種遊戲模式，包括戰術行動、單人模式、偽裝潛入，以及限時玩法活動。無論你偏好戰術配合還是孤軍奮戰，戰鬥方式由你作主。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/821e42582634e319cc342d8bdedbcead.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/821e42582634e319cc342d8bdedbcead.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《Arena Breakout: Infinite》中，公平戰鬥不只是一句承諾——更是我們不斷進化的反作弊系統給予的保證。系統內支援淘汰重播功能，當你發現可疑行為時，可快速檢舉。此外，若確認你因作弊行為而輸掉對戰，系統將自動向你的倉庫發放遊戲內補償。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/6a223b6316ef888690091bb0714a0d55.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/6a223b6316ef888690091bb0714a0d55.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《Arena Breakout: Infinite》中，每一次入局都是一場在榮耀與毀滅之間的博弈。從激烈的PvP交火到充滿挑戰的PvE遭遇戰，每一個決定都伴隨著風險、回報和後果。智取、力敵並成功撤離——在暗區將你完全吞噬之前。在卡莫納，真正的勝利屬於那些能夠適應環境、生存下來並帶著戰利品滿載而歸的人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/0241799e7596cd4ac24dc6e37c7d437f.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/3754e30e3d49d9e137bcbb6bffe10409.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/3754e30e3d49d9e137bcbb6bffe10409.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掌握6張各具特色的地圖，涵蓋混亂的室內近戰、開闊地形以及充滿變數的野外火拼。適應逼真的動態天氣系統——包括晴天、黑夜、大霧、暴雨和極寒暴雪——在這裡，能見度的驟降可能就是撤離與死亡的分水嶺。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/35363ba129d760d47e2272ef5044970e.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/dfd52b8e8417b310b8883907061d9968.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/dfd52b8e8417b310b8883907061d9968.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >體驗專為軍事愛好者打造的無與倫比的改槍系統。在75多把基礎槍械上，你可以透過20多個配件位置和900多種改裝零件，親手打造出獨一無二的戰術傑作。微調操控性、後座力和射程，為不同的對戰優化你的裝備配置，讓每一次改裝都完全契合你的手感。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/53731eb60448e2aa7039c7a3789cefb3.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/19f4e004623d3a5b0beb19dd11a7be26.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/19f4e004623d3a5b0beb19dd11a7be26.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >踏入卡莫納，體驗更加順暢的入局流程。直觀的教學和豐富的易用性功能將幫助你熟悉規則並掌握基礎操作。隨著你從一名新兵成長為傳奇的專業特遣隊員，你將在三個不同的難度等級中不斷進階——普通模式、封鎖區和強化封鎖區。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1128 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/80e097a8dffb97a548d514e494edf0f4.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/45be9458d59f50a007452a7dc96c0483.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/45be9458d59f50a007452a7dc96c0483.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Arena Breakout: Infinite》為所有特遣隊員提供了多種遊戲模式，包括戰術行動、單人模式、偽裝潛入，以及限時玩法活動。無論你偏好戰術配合還是孤軍奮戰，戰鬥方式由你作主。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/1a1f050946dbe1a09f820ec985ef4e10.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/821e42582634e319cc342d8bdedbcead.avif?t=1791983571\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras_big/821e42582634e319cc342d8bdedbcead.webp?t=1791983571 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在《Arena Breakout: Infinite》中，公平戰鬥不只是一句承諾——更是我們不斷進化的反作弊系統給予的保證。系統內支援淘汰重播功能，當你發現可疑行為時，可快速檢舉。此外，若確認你因作弊行為而輸掉對戰，系統將自動向你的倉庫發放遊戲內補償。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.poster.avif?t=1791983571\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.webm?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2073620/extras/ea524183bc643195a06de5b878553f5c.mp4?t=1791983571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
   "short_description": "《Arena Breakout:  Infinite》是一款高風險的戰術撤離射擊遊戲，每一次決策都至關重要。 在激烈交火中生存，搜尋珍貴物資並活著逃脫——否則將失去一切。憑藉令人驚嘆的真實畫面、貼近真實的音效設計，以及殘酷的PvPvE戰鬥，每一次突襲都是一場關乎榮耀或毀滅的豪賭。",
   "supported_languages": "英文<strong>*</strong>, 繁體中文<strong>*</strong>, 德文, 俄文, 日文, 葡萄牙文 - 巴西, 西班牙文 - 拉丁美洲, 簡體中文<strong>*</strong>, 法文<br><strong>*</strong>具備完整音效支援的語言",
   "reviews": "“Arena Breakout aims to be a steely military simulator.”<br>IGN<br><br>“Arena Breakout: Infinite is a fun game that I can see myself turning to again and again.”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“If you are a fan of realistic military shooters, you should definitely check out Arena Breakout Infinite.”<br>Sportskeeda<br>",
